ount the following.factorsfor imposing a punishment higher than the minimum term of imprisonment oramount of fine, namely:-(a) the use or tfueat of use of violence or arms by the offender;(b) the fact that the offender holds a public office and that he has takenadvantage of that office in committing the offence;(c) the fact that the minors are affected by the offence or the minors areused for the commission of an offence;(d) the fact that the offence is committed in an educational institution orsocial service facility or in the immddiate vicinity of such instihrtionor faculty or in other place to which school children and studentsresort for educational, sports and social activities.;
